    <h2 style="color:navy">About me</h2>

<p style="text-align:left">
I am Noam El-dor Turkenitz. I am 16 years old. <br />
I live in Kfar Saba and study at Katznelson High School. <br />
Ever since I was little, I have loved music, and now I can't imagine a single day without listening to it. <br />
I love listening to all kinds of music. I have been playing the guitar for over 3 years. <br />
At some point last year, I considered joining the music major in my high school. <br />
However, I didn't know anyone there, and I thought that I wasn't good enough to get in. <br />
I decided to dedicate this website to music because of my love and passion for it. <br />
In addition, I have been training in Capoeira for almost a decade, and music is a very important part of it as well. <br />
In conclusion, I decided to create this website to show my love for music in general. <br />
I hope that everyone who joins this website enjoys and admires music as much as I do.
</p>
